<title>USA: PCA suspends qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>PCA suspends qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MATTHEWS, N.C. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PCA International Inc said on Wednesday that its board of directors voted to suspend payment of its $0.07 per share quarterly dividend, because of its potential acquisition of American Studios Inc.</p>
<p>The company said it would suspend the dividend in anticipation of the financial requirements of the potential acquisition.</p>
<p>On November 25, PCA said it signed a non-binding letter of intent to buy American Studios for $2.50 per share in cash.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
